      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know, i totally get that, but my doctor is super hard to reach and it's the weekend so i can't really get through to them. i'm just looking for some general info. i've seen people take sudafed all the time and it's just an over the counter thing, so is there like a major risk i should actually be worried about? or is it mostly just a precaution? it's just a stuffy nose, nothing crazy.",
