      "content": "saline spray is fine for light stuff but my nose is like totally blocked, i can barely sleep lol. i'm not really worried about my heart rate or anything, i don't feel like i have any heart issues. i just need something that actually works so i can breathe. if i just take a standard dose of the sudafed, like one pill, is it really gonna be that dangerous? seems like a lot of worry for just one pill of over the counter stuff.",
